OL,3,GNEWSAHow heritage cash has saved
OL,4,Alandmark buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeritage sites across the North West
OL,7,Fhave been receiving much-needed
OL,8,Fupgrades over the last 12 months.
OL,10,FThey have been using their share of a
OL,11,F#15m funding pot from Historic England,
OL,12,Faimed at rescuing historic buildings
OL,13,Ffrom dereliction or demolition.
OL,15,FAmong the sites to get money were
OL,16,FSalford Lads and Girls Club in Greater
OL,17,FManchester, and Morecambe's Winter
OL,18,FGardens.
OL,20,FHistoric England said the work to bring
OL,21,Fnew life to heritage "can help build a
OL,22,Fbetter future for people and places".
